strata-dsv41

This repository is a trimmed copy of Strata (https://github.com/Niko1221/Strata) at commit
13eedf552 (2026-11-11), the last upstream commit with the DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash engine. Upstream
removed DeepSeek in Strata 0.2.14.

